      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZAG01OBM-001.
               CALL 'ZAG01OBM' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZAG01OBM FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
